@startuml F5.8-D03-desativar-disciplina
title F5.8-D03 — Desativar disciplina
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Secretaria" as Sec
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "SubjectController" as Ctrl
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Sec -> WebApp: Toggle desativar
WebApp -> Jwt: PUT /academico/disciplinas/{id}\n{ ativo: false }
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> Postgres: UPDATE ativo=false\n+ audit_log
note right of Ctrl
  matrículas preservadas
end note
Postgres --> Ctrl: OK (COMMIT)
Ctrl --> WebApp: 200 + _links.activate
WebApp --> Sec: badge Inativa

@enduml
